# Item_CollectWeaponLevelUp: the power-up's touch native (ruling 5, 2). A real state reaches it
# (the stepped runner collected one in 5 fuzz runs, P4 kickoff 2026-10-27), the timed corpus
# never: the cases run at Item_CollectBigHealth's first call, the same moment for another pickup
# (g_FoundBox = the collecting player's box), with the weapon level (record +$2A, 0-6) below and
# at the cap in both records (whichever player collected).

at $013440

case level_0              # raised to 1
w $FFFFF67A = 0
w $FFFFF6BA = 0

case level_5              # raised to 6
w $FFFFF67A = 5
w $FFFFF6BA = 5

case capped               # at 6: unchanged
w $FFFFF67A = 6
w $FFFFF6BA = 6
